Z||000000||b52buf||09-27-2001||10:10 PM||||Does anyone out there know of a good polish or compound to use to polish the outer surface of the tail light lens. The lens is foggy and looks kind of bad. Any suggestions appreciated especially from someone that has corrected the problem.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Leadfoot||09-27-2001||10:25 PM||||Welcome!  3M makes a plastic polish that is available in most auto stores.  However, to get a nice clear finish you will need to take a part the lens and polish the inside as well.<BR>||||reg||1
